OccAny-Depth-Min contains a focused extraction of code used by the OccAny
Unified6 depth experiment.

The DINOv2/Depth Anything 3 transformer layer code under
occany_depth_min/da3 is derived from Depth Anything 3 and DINOv2 and retains
their copyright and license headers. Those portions are provided under the
Apache License 2.0.
